Description: VeltOS Keyboard Lighting: a laptop keyboard's lights
 Turns a laptop keyboard's lights on or off and sets their brightness, in
 the layout of Windows 11's Dynamic Lighting. Keyboards that light up in
 colour (ASUS through asus-wmi, System76, the kernel's multicolour LEDs)
 also get a colour, "Match my accent colour" and, on ASUS, the breathing
 and colour cycle effects. The choices come back at every sign-in.
 .
 A small helper writes the light's files in /sys/class/leds through
 pkexec; polkit lets the signed-in user of the active session do it
 without a password.
